[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0039","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10383","title":"Lantronix SecureLinx Spider 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Lantronix SecureLinx Spider（SLS）2.2及以上版本存在跨站脚本漏洞（XSS/CWE-79），攻击者可在auth.asp登录页面注入恶意脚本代码。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造含恶意JavaScript的URL诱导管理员访问，在浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话令牌或凭据。该漏洞影响运行SSL/TLS加密Web管理界面的Lantronix设备，CVSS评分为6.1，中等危害。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10383"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-02T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:56Z","remediation":"升级到 Lantronix SecureLinx Spider 固件 2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 auth.asp 登录页面中 nickname 参数的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层部署 WAF 规则，拦截对 auth.asp 页面中 nickname 参数的恶意脚本输入，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/grymer/CVE/blob/master/CVE-2018-10383.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10383.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10383.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10383.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10383.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-10383.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/lantronix/securelinx_spider_firmware/CVE-2018-10383.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-10383.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-10383.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-10383.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-10383.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-10383.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0091","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14931","title":"Polaris FT Intellect Core Banking 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Polaris FT Intellect Core Banking 的 Core 和 Portal 模块存在开放重定向漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 /IntellectMain.jsp?IntellectSystem= 参数将用户重定向至恶意外部站点，结合社会工程学诱导用户点击恶意链接，可导致钓鱼攻击或凭证窃取。该漏洞影响 Polaris FT Intellect Core Banking 9.7.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低且无需身份认证，但需要用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14931"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-04-30T19:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:54Z","remediation":"升级 Polaris FT Intellect Core Banking 至 9.7.1 以上已修复版本；在 Web 服务器或应用层对 `/IntellectMain.jsp` 的 `IntellectSystem` 参数实施白名单校验，仅允许内部合法重定向目标 URL；部署 WAF 规则拦截包含外部域名的 `IntellectSystem` 参数请求；在代码层对重定向目标执行 URL 验证，拒绝非白名单域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://neetech18.blogspot.com/2019/03/polaris-intellect-core-banking-software_31.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14931.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14931.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14931.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-14931.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2018-14931-3323.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14931-3325.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14931-3324.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-14931.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14931.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Polaris FT Intellect Core Banking/CVE-2018-14931.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14931.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0016","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-4344","title":"Apple 多款产品内核内存破坏代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple多款产品内核存在内存破坏漏洞，攻击者可通过发送特制数据包或利用内核内存处理缺陷，触发内存越界访问从而实现内核代码执行。该漏洞影响iOS 12之前版本、macOS Mojave 10.14之前版本、tvOS 12之前版本及watchOS 5之前版本。攻击者需本地访问目标设备并诱导用户交互方可触发利用，CVSS评分为7.8，属于高危漏洞，可能导致攻击者获取内核级权限并完全控制受影响设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-4344"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-03T18:29:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:58:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Apple 2018 年 9 月发布的修复版本：iOS 12 或更高版本、macOS Mojave 10.14 或更高版本、tvOS 12 或更高版本、watchOS 5 或更高版本。iPhone/iPad 请通过「设置」>「通用」>「软件更新」在线升级；Mac 请通过 App Store 或「系统偏好设置」>「软件更新」安装 macOS Mojave 10.14；Apple TV 请通过「设置」>「系统」>「软件更新」升级；Apple Watch 请通过 iPhone 的 Watch 应用完成升级。如暂时无法升级，应在系统偏好设置中启用 Gatekeeper 并设置为仅允许来自 App Store 和已知开发者的应用，同时关闭不必要服务，以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/kb/HT209106","https://support.apple.com/kb/HT209107","https://support.apple.com/kb/HT209108","https://support.apple.com/kb/HT209139","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-4344","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-4344.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/55efb2d02584e111d0f0727ea3318f5516e9ecc7/cves/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/68dc5fd3dfceed2ead82f1041abf2d8a3fc020f5/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-4344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3ed8c658b6417422ff741957485ec0a908b97173/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3ed8c658b6417422ff741957485ec0a908b97173/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-4344","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-4344.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-4344.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0165","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0165.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20526","title":"Roxy Fileman 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Roxy Fileman 1.4.5 的 upload.php 文件存在任意文件上传漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 HTTP POST 请求直接上传恶意 PHP 文件至服务器。攻击者上传 webshell 后即可获取服务器完全控制权，执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有使用 Roxy Fileman 1.4.5 的 Web 应用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方至今未发布修复补丁，建议停止使用该版本或通过访问控制限制 upload.php 的访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20526"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-21T16:00:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:53:01Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 Roxy Fileman 的 upload.php 文件，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Nginx location 拒绝、Apache 的 <Files> 指令）限制对该文件的访问。在 uploads 目录下放置 .htaccess 文件，内容为 \"SetHandler default-handler\" 以防止 PHP 执行。如必须使用文件上传功能，建议替换为其他仍在维护的文件管理器组件，因为 Roxy Fileman 官方已停止更新且厂商失联，1.4.5 之后无安全修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/151033/Roxy-Fileman-1.4.5-File-Upload-Directory-Traversal.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46085/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46085","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20526.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20526.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/roxyfileman/roxy_fileman/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20526.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-20526/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-20526.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-20526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-20526.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0165.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0165.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0146","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19365","title":"Wowza Media Systems Wowza Streaming Engine 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Wowza Streaming Engine 4.7.4.01 的 REST API 存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制遍历服务器目录结构并读取任意敏感文件。该漏洞无需用户交互、攻击复杂度低、网络远程可利用，CVSS 3.1 评分 9.1（严重），影响机密性与可用性。攻击者可利用此漏洞获取服务器配置文件、源代码、日志等敏感信息，进而导致进一步攻击。受影响版本为 4.7.4.01，建议升级至官方修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19365"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-21T16:00:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:13Z","remediation":"升级 Wowza Streaming Engine 至 4.7.5.02 或更高版本以修复目录遍历漏洞。具体操作：访问 Wowza 官网下载最新版安装包（https://www.wowza.com/downloads/streaming-engine），停止服务后覆盖安装，重启服务并验证 /enginemanager/server/logs/download 接口不再接受 ../ 路径遍历参数。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理层拦截包含 ../ 的 logName 参数请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gdssecurity.com/labs/2019/2/11/wowza-streaming-engine-manager-directory-traversal-and-local.html","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/WowzaMediaSystems/public_cve/main/wowza-streaming-engine/CVE-2018-19365.txt","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19365.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19365.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-19365.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/83234ce456da3e90dda86dfbc5e605e64a846df3/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19365.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-19365.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19365-3467.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19365-3468.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19365-3466.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-19365.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19365.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Wowza Streaming Engine/CVE-2018-19365.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0143","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19276","title":"OpenMRS Platform 不安全的对象反序列化漏洞","description":"OpenMRS 平台在 2.24.0 版本之前存在不安全的对象反序列化漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含恶意构造 XML 数据的请求体，利用 Java 反序列化机制在服务器端执行任意系统命令，最终完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 OpenMRS 的医疗信息系统，攻击条件简单，无需凭据即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19276"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-21T16:00:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:03Z","remediation":"将 OpenMRS 的 webservices.rest 模块升级到 2.24.0 或更高版本，或将 OpenMRS Platform 升级到 2.24.0 及以上版本，同时将 OpenMRS Reference Application 升级到 2.8.1/2.7.2/2.6.2 等对应补丁版本。升级后检查应用日志中是否存在字符串 \"Failed to convert value of type 'java.util.HashMap' to required type 'org.openmrs.module.webservices.rest.SimpleObject'\"，以确认系统是否曾遭受利用尝试。注意：仅依赖 IP 白名单限制 Webservices 模块访问并不能防御此漏洞，必须通过版本升级修复。如暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙或反向代理层面阻断对 /ws/rest/ 路径的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/151553/OpenMRS-Platform-Insecure-Object-Deserialization.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155691/OpenMRS-Java-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://know.bishopfox.com/advisories/news/2019/02/openmrs-insecure-object-deserialization","https://talk.openmrs.org/t/critical-security-advisory-cve-2018-19276-2019-02-04/21607","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46327/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47792","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19276.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19276.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-19276.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-19276.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2c6b2e1482debf55f607b200837f63426669df52/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19276.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19276.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19276/poc/pocsuite3/Openmrs_RCE_CVE-2018-19276.py","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/eac2926b138d2c21c1927fef7b940261b9b516f7/modules/exploits/multi/http/openmrs_deserialization.rb","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/openmrs/openmrs/CVE-2018-19276.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19276.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19276.md","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2018-19276"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0143.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0143.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0030","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10093","title":"AudioCodes 400HD 命令注入漏洞","description":"AudioCodes 400HD/420HD IP 电话在固件版本 2.2.12.126 中存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者可通过向设备发送包含恶意命令的构造网络请求，绕过身份认证机制在目标系统上执行任意操作系统命令，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响固件版本的 AudioCodes 400HD 系列 IP 电话设备，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级为高。攻击者无需用户交互即可通过网络远程利用此漏洞，成功利用后可完全控制设备，导致敏感信息泄露或进一步对内网发起渗透攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10093"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-21T16:00:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:29Z","remediation":"联系 AudioCodes 官方技术支持获取修复此漏洞的固件更新版本并升级固件至最新版本。如暂无法获取补丁，请立即将设备管理 Web 界面的管理员默认密码修改为高强度密码，防止攻击者利用 command.cgi 页面进行未授权命令注入。同时建议在防火墙或网络层面限制对 420HD 设备 Web 管理端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 地址连接；若业务不需要 Web 管理功能，应直接禁用 Web 界面以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/151116/AudioCode-400HD-Remote-Command-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jan/38","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46164/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46164","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10093.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-10093.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10093.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-10093.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10093-3157.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10093-3154.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10093-3156.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/AudioCodes 400HD/CVE-2018-10093.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10093.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10093.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-10093.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0128","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17422","title":"dotCMS 开放重定向漏洞","description":"dotCMS 5.0.2之前版本存在开放重定向漏洞，攻击者可通过向 `html/common/forward_js.jsp` 页面的 `FORWARD_URL` 参数或 `html/portlet/ext/common/page_preview_popup.jsp` 页面的 `hostname` 参数传入恶意URL，诱导用户点击后将其重定向至任意外部站点。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（点击链接），可被用于钓鱼攻击或绕过URL白名单检查。CVSS评分6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17422"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-07T23:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:48Z","remediation":"升级 dotCMS 至 5.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `forward_js.jsp` 和 `page_preview_popup.jsp` 中的开放重定向问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则，对 `FORWARD_URL` 和 `hostname` 参数进行白名单校验，仅允许跳转到可信域名，或直接拦截包含外部域名的重定向请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dotCMS/core/issues/15286","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17422.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17422.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efaba81ff3ddee1a3747673a6ed45fa9a2a55580/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17422.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-17422.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-17422-3419.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-17422-3421.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-17422-3420.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-17422.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/dotCMS/CVE-2018-17422.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17422.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-17422.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0509","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18809","title":"TIBCO JasperReports Library 目录遍历漏洞","description":"TIBCO JasperReports 系列产品（包括 Library、Server 及 AWS 版本）的默认服务器实现存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。由于对用户提供的文件路径缺乏充分验证，已认证的 Web 服务器用户可通过在请求中构造包含 `../` 等路径遍历序列的特制 URL，突破目录限制访问主机系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 TIBCO JasperReports Library ≤6.3.4/6.4.1/6.4.2/6.4.21/7.1.0/7.2.0、JasperReports Server ≤6.3.4/6.4.0-6.4.3/7.1.0 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有 Web 服务器有效账户方可利用，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18809"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-07T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:56Z","remediation":"升级 TIBCO JasperReports Library 至 7.2.1 及以上版本，JasperReports Server 至 7.1.1 及以上版本，JasperReports Library Community Edition 至 6.7.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层添加规则，对 `/reportresource/reportresource/` 路径的 `resource` 参数进行路径遍历过滤，拦截包含 `../` 的请求。同时限制 Web 服务器运行账户对敏感文件（如 `js.jdbc.properties`）的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154406/Tibco-JasperSoft-Path-Traversal.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Sep/17","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107351","http://www.tibco.com/services/support/advisories","https://cybersecurityworks.com/zerodays/cve-2018-18809-tibco.html","https://security.elarlang.eu/cve-2018-18809-path-traversal-in-tibco-jaspersoft.html","https://www.tibco.com/support/advisories/2019/03/tibco-security-advisory-march-6-2019-tibco-jasperreports-library-2018-18809","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-18809","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18809.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18809.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2c6b2e1482debf55f607b200837f63426669df52/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2018/18xxx/CVE-2018-18809.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2018/18xxx/CVE-2018-18809.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/tibco/jasperreports_library/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2018-18809.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-18809.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0668","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20250","title":"RARLAB WinRAR 路径遍历漏洞","description":"WinRAR 5.61 及之前版本中 UNACEV2.dll 处理 ACE 格式文件名字段时存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可构造恶意 ACE 压缩包，通过特定文件名模式（如包含路径遍历序列）绕过解压目标文件夹限制，将文件写入任意绝对路径。攻击需诱导用户打开或解压恶意 ACE 文件（需用户交互），成功利用可实现任意文件写入，进而植入启动项、计划任务或覆盖系统文件实现远程代码执行。影响 WinRAR 5.61 及之前所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），CVE-2018-20250 已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。WinRAR 5.70 版本已修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本并避免打开不可信压缩包。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20250"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-02-05T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 WinRAR 至 5.70 版本或更高版本（官方已移除有漏洞的 UNACEV2.dll），或从官网 https://www.win-rar.com/download.html 下载最新版安装覆盖。若暂时无法升级，请卸载 WinRAR 或在杀毒软件/防火墙中禁止打开 .ace 文件，并避免打开来源不明的压缩包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152618/RARLAB-WinRAR-ACE-Format-Input-Validation-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/windows/fileformat/winrar_ace","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106948","https://github.com/blau72/CVE-2018-20250-WinRAR-ACE","https://research.checkpoint.com/extracting-code-execution-from-winrar/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46552/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46756/","https://www.win-rar.com/whatsnew.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-20250","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46756","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-20250.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2018-20250.yar","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2018/CVE-2018-20250.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e6e8b9ac06818dca482495dce43afc9e74dfd4e2/2018/CVE-2018-20250.json","https://github.com/0x0be/PEpper/blob/9dfcade04b41422b5c8457956f984cd25fe3e6d2/rules/CVE_Rules/CVE-2018-20250.yar","https://github.com/RoomaSec/RmTools/blob/db80cb3f19c2f378e4cb6c0d2b3960ff0db0ea45/yara_scanner_beta/yara_rules/Yara-Rules/cve_rules/CVE-2018-20250.yar","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-2025.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20250.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules_index.yar","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-20250.md","https://github.com/WyAtu/CVE-2018-20250","https://github.com/QAX-A-Team/CVE-2018-20250","https://github.com/easis/CVE-2018-20250-WinRAR-ACE","https://github.com/arkangel-dev/CVE-2018-20250-WINRAR-ACE-GUI","https://github.com/STP5940/CVE-2018-20250"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0686","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20753","title":"Kaseya VSA RMM 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Kaseya VSA 远程监控管理软件存在严重安全漏洞，影响 R9.3 9.3.0.35 之前版本、R9.4 9.4.0.36 之前版本及 R9.5 9.5.0.5 之前版本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞在所有受管设备上执行任意 PowerShell 载荷，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞源于 VSA 服务器对管理指令验证不当，攻击者无需认证即可向受管端点推送恶意 PowerShell 命令，实现远程代码执行并完全控制受管设备。该漏洞 CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互，2018 年 1 月已遭在野活跃利用，影响范围极广，危害极大。Kaseya 已在后续版本中修复该漏洞，建议立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20753"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-02-05T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:53:24Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Kaseya VSA RMM 升级至 R9.3 9.3.0.35 或更高版本、R9.4 9.4.0.36 或更高版本、R9.5 9.5.0.5 或更高版本。通过 Kaseya 官方下载中心下载对应版本补丁包，按官方升级指南停止 VSA 服务、备份数据库、应用补丁包、重启服务并验证版本号。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 VSA 服务器仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 5721/443 端口，并禁用非必要的 PowerShell 远程执行策略作为临时缓解措施。建议立即排查所有托管设备是否存在异常 PowerShell 进程执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.huntresslabs.com/deep-dive-kaseya-vsa-mining-payload-c0ac839a0e88","https://helpdesk.kaseya.com/hc/en-gb/articles/360000333152","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-20753","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-20753.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2018/CVE-2018-20753.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20753.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20753.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-20753.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-20753.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-20753.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-20753.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-20753/README.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-20753.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0686.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0686.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0093","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-15517","title":"D-Link Central WiFiManager CWM-100 服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"D-Link Central WiFiManager CWM-100 设备 1.03 r0098 版本的 MailConnect 功能存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。该功能本应用于检测与 SMTP 服务器的连接，但由于未对目标地址和端口进行有效限制，实际允许向任意 IP 的任意端口发起出站 TCP 连接。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造形如 `/index.php/System/MailConnect/host/127.0.0.1/port/22/secure/` 的特制 URI 触发该漏洞，利用内网探测、端口扫描等方式获取敏感信息或进一步攻击内部服务。该漏洞影响 D-Link Central WiFiManager CWM-100 设备，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15517"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-31T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:42:41Z","remediation":"立即将 D-Link Central WiFiManager CWM-100 升级至 1.03R0100-Beta1 或更高版本。升级前先备份配置文件，卸载旧版本后安装新版本。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制 CWM-100 服务器的出站 TCP 连接，仅允许访问指定 SMTP 服务器地址，阻止对任意 IP 和端口的出站请求，以缓解 SSRF 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/150243/D-LINK-Central-WifiManager-CWM-100-1.03-r0098-Server-Side-Request-Forgery.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Nov/28","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15517.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15517.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15517.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-15517.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15517-3331.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15517-3333.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15517-3332.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/D-Link/CVE-2018-15517.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15517.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-15517.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15517.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0129","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17431","title":"Comodo UTM Firewall Web Console 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Comodo UTM Firewall 2.7.0 之前版本的 Web 控制台存在身份验证绕过漏洞（CWE-287）。远程攻击者无需任何认证，通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可绕过登录验证，直接以管理员权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Comodo UTM Firewall 全系列 2.7.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者只需知道目标 Web 控制台地址即可发起攻击，利用门槛极低。厂商建议用户升级至 2.7.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17431"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-30T15:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:49Z","remediation":"升级 Comodo UTM Firewall 至 2.7.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Web Console 无需认证即可执行任意代码的问题。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制对 Web Console 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 连接，并禁用公网暴露。同时建议修改默认管理员口令并启用双因素认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159246/Comodo-Unified-Threat-Management-Web-Console-2.7.0-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BzFJhNQNHcoTbndsUmNjVWNGYWNJaWxYcWNyS2ZDajluTDFz/view","https://github.com/Fadavvi/CVE-2018-17431-PoC#confirmation-than-bug-exist-2018-09-25-ticket-id-xwr-503-79437","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48825","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17431.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17431.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-17431.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-17431.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d6fc9ff28c4abd374cb52cea6da5e12ba4af04e/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17431.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-17431.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-17431-3424.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-17431-3423.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-17431-3422.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-17431/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-17431.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Comodo UTM Firewall/CVE-2018-17431.yaml","https://github.com/Fadavvi/CVE-2018-17431-PoC","https://github.com/sanan2004/CVE-2018-17431-Comodo"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0200","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-13374","title":"Fortinet FortiOS 访问控制不当导致 LDAP 凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 和 FortiADC 存在不安全的访问控制漏洞，攻击者可通过将 LDAP 服务器连通性测试请求指向恶意 LDAP 服务器，从而获取 FortiGate 中配置的 LDAP 服务器登录凭据。该漏洞影响 FortiOS 6.0.2、5.6.7 及更早版本，以及 FortiADC 6.1.0、6.0.0~6.0.1、5.4.0~5.4.4 版本。攻击者需具备网络访问能力并搭建恶意 LDAP 服务器触发测试请求，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13374"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-01-22T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:39:17Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 6.0.3 及以上版本，FortiADC 升级至 6.1.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 FortiGate 管理界面中禁用 LDAP 服务器连通性测试功能，或限制仅允许可信 IP 执行 LDAP 诊断操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-18-157","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-13374","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46171","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-13374.md","htt